{"id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-tree-frame.md","title":"Finite GL Tree Frame","display":"df-gl-tree-frame — Finite GL Tree Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","aliases":["89-df-gl-tree-frame"],"display":"df-gl-tree-frame — Finite GL Tree Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-tree-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-tree-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-tree-frame — Finite GL Tree Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架。以下“树”以严格祖先关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 表示，不以直接父子边表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取现有框架及有限性定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)\\)</span> 是下面定义的有限有根树框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tree\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\exists r\\in W\\ \n\\bigl[\\forall w\\in W\\ (w=r\\lor rRw)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n((wRy\\land xRy)\\to(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tree\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\exists r\\in W\\ \n\\bigl[\\forall w\\in W\\ (w=r\\lor rRw)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n((wRy\\land xRy)\\to(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 5 章，印刷页 83–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n每个世界的祖先线性排列，且根到达其余全部世界。对有根有限 GL 模型，用从根出发的严格路径作为新世界，取严格前缀关系；传递且非自反的有限原框架保证只有有限多条路径。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tree\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLTree}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\exists r\\in W\\ \n\\bigl[\\forall w\\in W\\ (w=r\\lor rRw)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n((wRy\\land xRy)\\to(wRx\\lor w=x\\lor xRw))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"69407d4d0243b2de","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这类真值树与 [[89-df-gl-tree-frame]] 的关系框架不同；这里只定义前者，后一链接是术语比较，不是数学依赖。"},{"id":"3ac630427c1d6d52","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLTree}$ 是有限有根 GL 树框架谓词，取 [[89-df-gl-tree-frame]] 的签名。"},{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee8821b1cefc81b2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","9cd755e57aea2c47"]}